\newlabel{tbl:contamination-gallery}{{1}{11}{Seed-aggregated descriptive display of robust-vs-naive accuracy under each contamination mechanism (\(n = 24\) trials × 64 seeds at strength 0.60). \protect \texttt {Reliable} is a display flag for the pooled-selected member: it is \protect \texttt {Yes} only when that member beats naive in at least 0.95 of seeds \emph {and} its displayed difference CI excludes zero. This is an across-seed screen, not one lucky seed, a p-value, or selection-free post-selection inference}{tbl:contamination-gallery}{}}
