\newlabel{tbl:robustness-onset}{{2}{16}{Per-mechanism descriptive onset and worst-rate accuracy (\(n = 24\) trials × 64 seeds). The onset rate is where the pooled display method reaches the displayed win-fraction rule (win fraction \ensuremath {\ge } 0.95); it is not a per-seed selection, selection-free inferential result, or universal crossover claim}{tbl:robustness-onset}{}}
